    <abstract>The data package contains 10 anonymized datasets of scalp-recorded EEG in MATLAB (.mat) format. Each .mat file contains EEG data from one experimental subject. Data matrices have been preprocessed and are presented as 2D trials-by-feature matrices and 3D electrodes-by-time-by-trial matrices. Dimensionality reduction/PCA has not been performed.</abstract>
